title: Political Rally
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: rally_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rally_timer = 6
card-image: img/George_Jones_Speech.jpg
go-to: main_rally; ful_disrupt if ful_strength > 180 and not ful_banned and not return_to_normalcy

@ful_disrupt

The SCPSs FUL has disrupted our rally! Their street troops are preventing us from meeting.

- @police_protect: Call the police to protect our rally.
- @ufc_protect: Use the UFC(SS) to protect our rally.
- @both_protect: The police and UFC(SS) should work together to protect our rally.
- @cancel: Cancel the rally.

@police_protect
view-if: ccf_ss_prussia == 1
on-arrival: police_protect_success = city_police_loyalty * city_police_militancy * city_police_strength*2 - ful_militancy*ful_strength;
go-to: police_protect_win if police_protect_success >= 0; police_protect_lose if police_protect_success < 0

@police_protect_win
go-to: main_rally

The police successfully protected our rally, so it can go ahead as usual.

@police_protect_lose
on-arrival: strife += 1; workers_scps += 3

Unfortunately, the police were unable or unwilling to hold back the FUL mob. The SCPSs have won this show of strength.

@ufc_protect
on-arrival: ufc_success = ufc_strength*ufc_militancy - ful_strength*ful_militancy; strife += 1
go-to: ufc_protect_win if ufc_success >= 0; ufc_protect_lose if ufc_success < 0

@ufc_protect_win
go-to: main_rally

The UFC(SS) has successfully protected our rally against the FUL! Our meeting can go ahead as usual.

@ufc_protect_lose
on-arrival: workers_scps += 3; ufc_strength -= 50

Unfortunately, the UFC(SS) was not able to hold back the FUL mob. The SCPSs have won this show of strength.

@both_protect
view-if: ccf_ss_prussia
choose-if: city_police_training > 0
unavailable-subtitle: The loyal sections of the police have never coordinated with the UFC(SS) before.
on-arrival: ufc_success = ufc_strength*ufc_militancy - ful_strength*ful_militancy + city_police_loyalty*city_police_militancy*city_police_strength*2; strife += 1
go-to: both_protect_win if ufc_success >= 0; both_protect_lose if ufc_success < 0

@both_protect_win
go-to: main_rally

The police and UFC(SS) have successfully protected our rally against the FUL! Our meeting can go ahead as usual.

@both_protect_lose
on-arrival: workers_scps += 3; ufc_strength -= 50

Unfortunately, the police and UFC(SS) were not able to hold back the FUL mob. The SCPSs have won this show of strength.


@cancel
on-arrival: workers_scps += 3;

The FUL have won this show of strength.

@main_rally

Mass rallies are a common feature of social democratic life, especially in the lead-up to an election. What is the primary theme of this rally?

- @rally_cooperative_commonwealth: Spread the ideals of a Cooperative Commonwealth 
- @welfare: Agitate for a stronger relief program in the face of the Drought and Economic Crisis
- @blame_old_line: Blame the old-line parties for doing nothing
- @pacifism: Opposing war, nationalism, and militarism at all costs.
- @wtb: Support the WTB plan!
- @local: A mixture of various local and national concerns that resonate most with the audience.
- @easy_discard

@rally_cooperative_commonwealth
on-arrival: workers_ccf_ss += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_ccf_ss += 3*(1-dissent) if true_socialist_strength > managerial_strength; workers_ccf_ss += 4*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; unemployed_ccf_ss += 3*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; true_socialist_strength += 5; true_socialist_dissent -= 5; old_middle_ccf_ss -= 3; new_middle_ccf_ss -= 2;

Spreading the gospel of a true Cooperative Commonwealth increases general support for Socialism, both among farmers and worker alike. 

@welfare
on-arrival: workers_ccf_ss += 3*(1-dissent); workers_ccf_ss += 3*(1-dissent) if welfare > 0; unemployed_ccf_ss += 3*(1-dissent) if welfare > 0; unemployed_ccf_ss += 4*(1-dissent) if welfare > 1; managerial_strength += 3; managerial_dissent -= 3; labour_dissent -= 3;

Speaking of a strong welfare state certainly agitates the workers and farmers who have been downtrodden by the lack of an adequate relief program. 

@blame_old_line
on-arrival: workers_ccf_ss += 23*(1-dissent); farmers_ccf_ss += 33*(1-dissent); new_middle_ccf_ss += 23*(1-dissent)

Blaming the old parties certainly invokes anger among the populace. 

@pacifism
view-if: year >= 1939 and year <= 1945
on-arrival: pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 2*(1 - dissent); workers_ccf_ss += 4*(1 - dissent) if pacifism >= 3; unemployed_ccf_ss += 3*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3; nationalism -= 3*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3; new_middle_ccf_ss += 4*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3

Our speakers denounce the military establishment and all the spending entering that black hole. Some adventurous speakers question the responsibility of the military elites in organizing the Great War.

[? if pacifism < 3 : Given the volume of nationalist indoctrination in our society, it is difficult to argue so vehemently against the military. ?]
[? if pacifism >= 3 : Since we have consistently made pacifism a theme of our campaign, the workers are enthusiastic about our message. ?]

@wtb
view-if: wtb_adopted = 1
choose-if: return_to_normalcy = 0
unavailable-subtitle: The economic crisis is largely over now, and the public is no longer interested in hearing about it.
on-arrival: wtb_support += 1; workers_ccf_ss += 6*(1-dissent); unemployed_ccf_ss += 6*(1-dissent); farmers_ccf_ss += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_ccf_ss += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_ccf_ss += 3*(1-dissent);

The WTB plan has become a popular rallying cry for our party. The workers are eager to go back to work, and that is exactly what the plan promises.


@local
on-arrival: workers_ccf_ss += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_ccf_ss += 1*(1-dissent); new_middle_ccf_ss += 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_ccf_ss += 3*(1-dissent);

Our speakers have gauged the mood and are speaking to the issues that seem to most affect the people in this moment. 
